Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:04.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(戴尔·阿诺食品  把丰收带回家)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(一号板子  雷吉·门罗)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.23,0:00:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小镇被攻陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The town was overrun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:00:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和尼古拉斯先走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He split off with Nicholas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had this idea that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.16,0:01:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他放火  就能阻止行尸过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he lit a fire, it would stop the walkers from coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过换我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to go instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:12.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火一直没有点起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fire never got lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.60,0:01:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不得不走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说如果他被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said if he got stuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.64,0:01:26.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会想办法给我们发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would find a way to send us a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.73,0:01:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}A signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.83,0:01:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.81,0:01:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:02:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.69,0:03:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能听见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of you saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一半的行尸回来了  \N{\fnArial\fs30}They got back here, half of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足够把我们死死围住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still enough to surround us 20 deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没见过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.27,0:04:09.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没经历过这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been through anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们目前是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:17.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡车撞上的板子好像没有受损\N{\fnArial\fs30}The panel the truck hit seems intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们加固了它  以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}We reinforced it just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎么样  墙都能支撑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, the wall's gonna hold together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其余的人会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others, they're gonna be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  亚伯拉罕  萨沙  他们有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, Abraham, Sasha, they have vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会引走行尸  就跟另一半一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna lead 'em away, just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦和尼古拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Glenn and Nicholas are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后会从前门回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna walk back through the front gate after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what they're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也知道我们该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we know what we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽量不要出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep noise to a minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.31,0:05:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上拉上百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull our blinds at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好别开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better, keep the lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽量让这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll try to make this place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像墓地一样安静  看看行尸会不会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}as quiet as a graveyard, see if they move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方就是个墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,采石场的缺口开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The quarry broke open
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些行尸在往这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those walkers were heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:36.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克安排的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plan that Rick put into place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止了那一切的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}stopped that from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他引开了一半行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got half of them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前跟达里尔一起出去招人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out there recruiting with Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想进入罐头厂找点补给\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to try to get into a cannery and scavenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而达里尔想继续找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Daryl wanted to keep looking for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做了我想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did what I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.31,0:06:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后落入了那些人的陷阱之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we wound up in a trap set by those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.02,0:06:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我丢了背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I lost my pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定是跟踪了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must've followed our tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.44,0:06:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攻击我们的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people who attacked us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我  他们才找到了过来的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}they found their way back here because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他事我们以后再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be more to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:00.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不在墙内埋葬杀人凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't bury killers inside the walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.63,0:08:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We aren't going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:17.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.49,0:08:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点材料都不够我做两餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even make two meals out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多掺点水就能把汤和酱料煮成一大锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soups and sauces can be stretched out with some extra water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假如我们明天就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference does that make
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样做又有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we'll be dead tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-现在得定量配给  -我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to ration now-- - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法在剩下的时间里看着家人挨饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't spend whatever time I have left watching my family starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  -抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  奥利维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:53.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得没有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't see the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.11,0:09:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上  住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.95,0:09:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西是要供给所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This stuff is for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要想活命我们必须从长计议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to make it last if we're gonna survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何不去确认一下大门关好了  斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go make sure the gate's closed, Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  那怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.55,0:09:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但墙外的那辆卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that truck outside the walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.51,0:09:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我  它就冲进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd be inside if it wasn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.95,0:09:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们现在就没办法在这谈话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we wouldn't be talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.30,0:09:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你当时在哪呢  布鲁斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you, Bruce?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么做会让我们踏上无所忌惮之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doing this will start us down a road where nothing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在乎任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where no one else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后当我们毁了这个地方后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we'll all look back at this moment right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会回首这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}as when we destroyed this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(大卫  斯特奇斯  阿德里安  尼古拉斯  格伦)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手电筒  钢筋  绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flashlights, the rebar, the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在远处把它们放下墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lower them off the wall a good distance apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.15,0:11:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许转一转它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe spin them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样  行尸就会被吸引过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, the walkers are drawn to each one
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你开一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you open up a path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你在做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're gearing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:09.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就等着天黑了  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just waiting for dark, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跳下去时扭到脚怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you twist an ankle jumping down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你被一个行尸缠住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you just get slowed down by one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后得应对所有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you have to deal with all of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你阻止不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我打算帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道一条更安全的出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know a safer way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(农作物  玉米)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(大麦  苜蓿)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(小麦)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(磨坊)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(教育  训练)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.67,0:13:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(指导纲领  选举)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(教育  训练  贸易  医学  知识  安保)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(电力)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.93,0:13:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(扩张)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(探索)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(总有一天  你所承受过的痛苦会有助于你)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.75,0:14:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-斯宾塞  -是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spencer? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喝醉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:24.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从储藏室拿的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This came from the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.63,0:14:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你偷的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You-- you stole it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.82,0:14:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说得那么难听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你跟大家说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you told everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是屁话不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was just bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.66,0:14:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  如果他们都去抢储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. If they all went in and raided the pantry and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被大家知道  看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone knew it, saw it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.60,0:14:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then that would be the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果只有一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one person?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么谁也不会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}One person, and no one ever would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:05.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  为什么不是我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.85,0:15:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我阻止了劫掠食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped that little run at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.71,0:15:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该得到些奖励\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次最后的庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}One last celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们是对的  妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they were right, Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna be dead real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.68,0:15:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在说的才是屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that is some bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是因为你  我们才会玩完\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the reason we're so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你让我们变成这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made us this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.57,0:15:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里从没有安全过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were never safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你只想自欺欺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't want to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只想欺骗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't want us to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.02,0:15:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只想做白日梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wanted to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸和艾登身上发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Dad, to Aiden,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.82,0:16:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't I be?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到伊妮德了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen Enid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.47,0:16:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到她跟你在一起后就没见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since I saw her with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她在尸群到来之前翻墙出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she went over the wall just before the herd came and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在她被困在外面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now she's trapped out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.47,0:16:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道她没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think she isn't dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.31,0:16:47.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:56.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:16:58.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:16:59.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果你能爬到...  -我不会帮你的  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you maybe climb up-- - I'm not helping you, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.18,0:17:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了伊妮德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for Enid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你的朋友  -我的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your friend. - My girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  反正她曾经是  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, I mean, 'cause she was any way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.19,0:17:14.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这么不管她了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to just leave her out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我警告过她不要翻墙出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her to stop going over the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉过她外面有坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her there's bad people out there
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么做很蠢很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that it's stupid and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你知道自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not gonna let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:31.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  你不能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, you're not going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去告诉你爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会出去找你  其他人也会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll go out there to find you, then other people will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就会有人送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then somebody's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.34,0:17:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救过我的命  现在我在救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life and now I'm saving yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心手滑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.78,0:18:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会夸你勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't tell you you're being brave, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还没醒  他的伤口已经感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hasn't woken up. His wound's infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.44,0:19:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以无论我怎么样都没意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it doesn't really matter what I'm being.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  可是你还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我头疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.32,0:19:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按1到10级算  有多疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a scale of one to 10, how bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.07,0:19:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骗你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想来看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just checking on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.01,0:19:32.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,茫然地坐在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clueless on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给别人包扎了伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}You patched people up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在努力帮助大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're...You're helping make things better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.40,0:19:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.31,0:19:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里发生的事已经够吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm so scared about what's happening in here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不敢想外边发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can't think about what's happening out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's actually good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.91,0:19:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道该怎么应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know what to do with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:58.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让他活下去  让行尸离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want him to live and for the roamers to go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想让一名真正的医生出现在门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for a doctor to show up at the gates
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.79,0:20:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样我就能回到自己的屋子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can go back to my apartment
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续看《战争与和平》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep reading "War and Peace."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:08.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而现在是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here comes the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还没死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不好说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不是感受不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I don't feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕的滋味不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, being afraid sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经不想面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to not want to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒不是我没有能力面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是我不想面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that I-- I didn't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在的生活就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is what life looks like now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.48,0:22:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须抗争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不抗争  我们就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't fight, we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是说不用翻过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said we weren't going over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:22:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.70,0:22:58.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从地下过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going under.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个入口通向一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This leads to a sewer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,旧住宅区的下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was part of the old neighborhood
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.38,0:23:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,存在于亚历山大建成之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was here before they built this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.65,0:23:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以通过它从墙下边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take us under the wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿能绕过行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hopefully past the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.99,0:23:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但剩下的路我一个人走\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm going on my own from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-玛姬...  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie... - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.96,0:23:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再看到任何人的名字被写到墙上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't-- I can't watch more names go up on that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.43,0:23:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-如果他还活着...  -如果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If he's alive-- - If?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.79,0:23:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟米琼恩说过如果他能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told Michonne he would've found
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.85,0:23:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会想办法给我们发信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}some way to signal us if he got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.43,0:23:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他还活着  或者受伤  \N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's alive or he's hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被困  被人抓走\N{\fnArial\fs30}or trapped, maybe taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.71,0:23:51.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他还活着  他就需要我的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he's alive, he needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.07,0:23:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.85,0:23:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他死了  我也不想傻傻地等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's dead, I don't want to be waiting on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些都不是你的错  你没必要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is your fault. You don't need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.57,0:24:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.04,0:24:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:12.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须背负着这份罪孽活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.22,0:24:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灾变后我就没有来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been down here since the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.70,0:24:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这梯子肯定很早以前就倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ladder must've fallen a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.06,0:24:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试试搬开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try and get it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.03,0:24:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -我数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - On three, ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.99,0:24:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.54,0:24:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.33,0:24:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  被梯子绊了一跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. The ladder caught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.39,0:25:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.43,0:25:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.94,0:25:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.85,0:25:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.45,0:25:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.68,0:25:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能需要缝针  亚伦  回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could need stitches. Aaron, just go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.99,0:26:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -快回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我刚救过你  -我一个人也能应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just there for you. - I could have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.72,0:26:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.74,0:26:08.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.39,0:26:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.01,0:26:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.14,0:27:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  萨沙  亚伯拉罕  收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, Sasha, Abraham, you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:08.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.83,0:27:10.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能上来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I come up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.89,0:27:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.53,0:27:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.23,0:27:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.16,0:27:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊妮德  她...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid, she, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.92,0:27:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她以前喜欢溜到墙外\N{\fnArial\fs30}she used to sneak over the walls,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.86,0:27:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在外面待一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}spend time out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.28,0:27:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道为什么  她就是想出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't know why. She just wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.40,0:27:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.79,0:27:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得袭击发生后她又出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she went out there after the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.41,0:27:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  她还在外面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, she's still out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.28,0:27:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.65,0:27:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.55,0:27:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但她知道该如何照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, but she knows how to take care of herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.16,0:27:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we can't go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.23,0:28:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔想试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl wanted to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.19,0:28:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我阻止了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stopped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.92,0:28:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他说  如果他敢出去我就告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him I'd tell you if he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.30,0:28:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  我也说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, um-- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.24,0:28:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得应该告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought I should tell you--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.06,0:28:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他现在在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where he is now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.80,0:28:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道  他现在回到屋子里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's back at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.04,0:28:10.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见他跟朱迪思在门廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him on the porch with Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:14.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意的话  我可以来看守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can keep guard, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.37,0:28:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那下面  有它们在看守这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down there, they're guarding the place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.54,0:28:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是为了留心还没回来的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just about keeping an eye out for the others that aren't back,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.49,0:28:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看有没有格伦的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for a sign from Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.39,0:28:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.68,0:28:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.61,0:28:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想你之前在采石场说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was thinking about what you said back at the quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, I mean, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:40.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得学会保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know how to protect myself
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.04,0:28:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护我妈妈和弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my mom and brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.55,0:28:45.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.22,0:28:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你能教我怎么开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can you teach me how to shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你的靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your target.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.75,0:29:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.86,0:29:18.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.64,0:29:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.19,0:29:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.06,0:29:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.90,0:29:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  害怕的滋味不好受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, being afraid sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.72,0:30:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.07,0:30:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需穿过几个行尸就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to get through a few them, then we're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.75,0:30:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.06,0:30:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.30,0:30:31.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.73,0:30:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以留下  我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.74,0:30:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.42,0:30:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.99,0:30:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-玛姬  -都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie. - It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.01,0:30:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他的最后一张照片烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned his last picture of him
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.99,0:30:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我说我不再需要照片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I said I wasn't gonna need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.16,0:30:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不会再离开他半步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I was never gonna be away from him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.22,0:31:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.44,0:31:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不想让我去外面  我答应了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want me to go out there and I said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.04,0:31:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I would've gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.64,0:31:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要是跟他一块去了  或许能帮上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I was with him, maybe I could've helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.55,0:31:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.55,0:31:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米琼恩说他早该发信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've shown me by now. That's what Michonne said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.27,0:31:30.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想看到他的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to see his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.08,0:31:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.57,0:31:37.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法预知将要发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get to know what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.49,0:31:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没法知道为什么会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't get to know why it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.08,0:31:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是我做的是对是错\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I did right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.85,0:31:44.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.02,0:31:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得接受这一切  你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to live with that. You do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.33,0:32:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆  我给你做了饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I made you some cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.64,0:32:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能请你拿到楼上来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you bring them up here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.71,0:32:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  山姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.22,0:32:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.62,0:32:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不想下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you wanna come downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.49,0:32:26.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是不想下楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't wanna go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.20,0:32:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面没什么变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}it didn't change up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.78,0:32:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都上了一多半台阶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm more than halfway up,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.28,0:32:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我算是在楼上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so technically I'm upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.45,0:32:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到这里不算是楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can come here and you won't be downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.13,0:33:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.43,0:33:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这样说是因为事实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to talk that way because that's how it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.50,0:33:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道  但你不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is now, I know, but you can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.61,0:33:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was all a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.25,0:33:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能活到现在  简直是个笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fact that we're alive-- it's a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.60,0:33:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.34,0:34:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.83,0:34:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔说她重伤了他们中一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol said she got one of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.01,0:34:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她找不到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she couldn't find the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.32,0:34:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定在那下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been under there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.67,0:34:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让这个地方存在下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want this place to stay standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.95,0:35:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得领导他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.72,0:35:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不需要我  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't need me, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.89,0:35:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they need is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对这个地方的设想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I wanted for this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.95,0:35:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的只是空中楼阁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}was it really just pie in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.33,0:35:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.21,0:37:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他回来以后  记得给他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he gets back, it's worth mentioning
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.40,0:37:28.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚伦 艾琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Aaron, Erin,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.45,0:37:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男女通用\N{\fnArial\fs30}works for a boy or a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.92,0:37:33.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据拼写不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}depending on the spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.27,0:37:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:37:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.11,0:38:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来换班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.15,0:38:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是卡萝尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Carol was up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.42,0:38:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她  我自愿替她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was. I volunteered to take her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.90,0:38:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没机会说过  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I never got a chance to say it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.44,0:38:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡车那事你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}you did good with the truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.56,0:38:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking out the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.54,0:38:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if it weren't for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.85,0:38:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墙现在也许不会立着\N{\fnArial\fs30}this wall might not be standing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.12,0:38:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.82,0:38:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好或走运  并不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good or lucky, it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.95,0:38:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只用继续做你所做的事就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep doing what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.83,0:39:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,墓地的那些尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those bodies by the graveyard...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.05,0:39:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以想等\N{\fnArial\fs30}the reason I wanted to wait was...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.09,0:39:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}was Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.15,0:39:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道他是否还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if he's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.59,0:39:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有达里尔  萨沙  亚伯拉罕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Daryl, Sasha, Abraham.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.73,0:39:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也希望他们现在回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted them back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.52,0:39:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想处理那些尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted those things gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.73,0:40:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想再等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.67,0:40:09.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说可能会花些时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it could go on a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.01,0:40:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过  的确有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did and it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.81,0:40:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  已经过了很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, it already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.85,0:40:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们或许还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.95,0:40:21.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会无视这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not moving past that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.29,0:40:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's just--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.19,0:40:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here, in this moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.13,0:40:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is it, this is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.40,0:40:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"现在的生活就是这样"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This is what life looks like now."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.07,0:40:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.77,0:40:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说没有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't saying there wasn't a future.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.75,0:40:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.72,0:41:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我还有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me there's more.
